          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netiyi namutunashimuni hinyi? Chikasa chaYehova anachimwekeshelinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, wakulilili kumesu indi neyi kamutondu kakovu, neyi muji wukumena hamaseki awuma; hakweti nimwekalilayi nimwawahilayuku; chitukumutala hakweti lubanji lwakumukeŋa kudetuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amudiwili, amúumbili kudi antu, muntu wayihuŋu, wenjililili yakala; amudiwili neyi muntu abutilaŋawu antu mesu awu, hitwamumwenikulemaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukatishilili nyiloŋa yetwetu, amuchikilili kuluwa kwetwetu; amweteli yena kulonda etu tumwenumu kuwunda; nanyinkakambu yindi yena anatukuswishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wetu tunajimbali neyi anyikoku, wejima wetutunadiyili iwu kunjila yindi, iwu kunjila yindi; Yehova namutwiki yena kuluwa kwetwetu ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukabishili, hakudizozelamu, kwasama mukanwa kindi nehi, neyimwana kamukoku akutwalawu nakujaha, neyi chamwenaŋayi mukoku hadi akwakumutewula zo-o, dichi niyena haasamini mukanwa kinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutweli chakumukabisha nakumusompesha; muyachi windi akuwushimuna kudinyi? Hetuŋa dawamomi amufumishiluhu, amweteli hamuŋawa wantu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amufuukwili nawu amujiiki nawantu atama, ilaŋa hafwiliyiamujiikili namukwakuheta; nanochu chabulilaŋayi madombu, nichabuliliyiyakutwamba mukanwa kindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova welili nindi chachiwahi kumuchika. Namukatishi. Chiwakalambula wumi windi wikali himulambu wahanshidi, dihu hakamonayi anyanindi, wakavulisha mafuku indi, mwatiyilayi Yehova kuwaha mwakalumbulukila mumakasindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakabakeni muchima windi wakamwenamu yindi, wakatiya kuwaha; kambuŋami waloŋa wakalopesha amavulu nakwiluka kwakumwilukawu; wakakoola kuluwa kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chinakamwinkela iseka dindi hamu nawamaneni, wakaanjaŋa ana yuma yakupupa kunjita hamuna wakwaŋovu; nanochu chamwaŋiliyi wumi windi hakufwa, nanochu chamubombeluwu hamu nawakwakuputola, hela chochu, hakusenda nshidiyawantu amavulu, hakulembelela niakwakuputola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
